  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yakobo alikonkenyepo ulwendo lwakwe, asuka afika na ku calo ca bantu babela ku kabanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mpanga iyo amona icishima ca menshi ne mikuni ya mpaanga itatu ilele mupepi ne cishima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pantu muli ici cishima baletapa amenshi ayakuti imikuni inwe. Icilibwe balecilika pa cishima cali icikalamba. Baleti cilya imikuni ya fitekwa yalongana, bakacema bakunkulusha bafumyapo icilibwe balecilika pa cishima, elyo batapa amenshi yakuti ifitekwa finwe. Kabili elyo balebwekesha icilibwe cakucilika pa cishima pa ncende yaciko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo aipwishe bakacema ati, “Mwe bamunyinane bushe ni kwi mwafuma?” Nabo bamwasuka abati, “Twafuma mu Harani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abepusha ati, “Bushe mwalishiba Labani, umwishikulu wakwa Naho?” Nabo bamwasuka abati, “Ee twalimwishiba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo abepusha ati, “Bushe ali umutende?” Nabo bayasuka abati, “Ee alifye umutende, no mwana wakwe umukashana Rakeli, uyu aleisa ali ne mpaanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo abeba ati, “Moneni akasuba kacili katuntulu. Ino taili nshita yakulonganika ifitekwa. Imwe fipeelenifye amenshi finwe, elyo mufibwekeshemo kukulya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bamwasuka abati, “Teti tucite ifyo kano imikuni yonse yalongana ne cilibwe bacilika pa cishima bacikunkulushapo. Lyena elyo tulenwesha ifitekwa amenshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo acili alelanda nabo, awe Rakeli aisa ali ne mpaanga shakwa wishi, pantu ali ni kacema mwanakashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya Yakobo amona Rakeli mwana Labani nalume, ali ne mpaanga shakwa Labani, awe Yakobo aya kunkulushapo icilibwe balecilika pa cishima. Apeela na menshi ku mpaanga shakwa nalume, shanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo atomona Rakeli pakumuposha, atendeka nokulila, aleikatisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaeba Rakeli ati, “Ine ndi lupwa lwa bawiso, nine mwana Rebeka.” Kanshi Rakeli epakubutuka aya ebako wishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya Labani aumfwa ifyo Rakeli amweba ukuti ni Yakobo mwana nkashi yakwe, Labani abutuka kukumukumanya. Awe amukukutila, kabili amutomona pakumuposha, elyo amusenda kumwakwe. Yakobo nao epakumushimikilako ifi fintu fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani epakumweba ati, “Iwe uli lupwa lwandi pakatifye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aikele na Labani umweshi umo utuntulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani epakumweba ati, “Bushe iwe ico uli lupwa lwandi, eco wingamombelafye ukwabula kulipilwa? Awe njebafye amalipilo ulefwaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani ali na bana abakashana babili. Ishina lya wamukalamba ni Leya, elyo uwamwaice ni Rakeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya ali na menso ayafuuka, lelo Rakeli ali no mubili uusuma kabili uwayemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo atemenwe Rakeli. Kanshi aebele Labani ati, “Nkamubombela pa myaka cine lubali pa mwana wenu umukashana Rakeli umwaice bantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani nao asosa ati, “Cena ico cawamapo ukuti namupeela kuli iwe ukucila ku muntu umbi. Iwe ikalafye kuno kwine kumwandi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yakobo abombele imyaka cine lubali pakuti bamupeele Rakeli. Lelo iyo myaka yamonekefye kwati ni nshiku shampendwa ico atemenwe Rakeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo aebele Labani ati, “Mpeeleni umukashi wandi. Inshita mwapimine naipwa ndefwaya tulelala nankwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Labani epakulonganika abantu bonse aba kulya kwine, atebeta ne mitebeto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo cilya caba icungulo, Labani abuula mwane Leya amutwala kuli Yakobo, na Yakobo asendama nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Labani apeela mwane Leya umwanakashi uwakumubombela, umukashana umusha wakwe, Silipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutifye cilya bwaca, Yakobo asanga ukuti ni Leya! Elyo aebele Labani ati, “Ngeco mwancitila ifi cinshi? Ine ilyo nalemubombela, nalefwaya Rakeli, bushe teifyo? Bushe kanshi cinshi mwancenjesesha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani amwasuka ati, “Ifwe kuno tatwaba na lutambi ulwakuufya umwaice ilyo umukalamba wakwe talati opwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi tala pwisha umulungu wakusefya ubwinga, lyena elyo tukakupeela no mwaice bantu wine, lelo ukamombela imyaka na imbi cine lubali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nao acita ifyo Labani asosele. Apwisha umulungu wakusefya ubwinga ali na Leya, elyo Labani amupeela mwane Rakeli ukuba umukashi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani apeela mwane Rakeli umwanakashi uwakumubombela, umukashana umusha wakwe, Bilua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo epakulasendama na Rakeli wine. Lelo Yakobo atemwishishepo Rakeli ukucila Leya. Kanshi alundilepo ukubombela Labani na imbi imyaka cine lubali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
