          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Yawe amwene ukuti Yakobo tatemenwe Leya, apeele Leya ubufyashi, lelo Rakeli wena ali ŋumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya epakuba pabukulu apaapa no mwana umwaume. Amwinika ne shina lya Rubeni, pantu asosele ati, “Nico Yawe namona ubulanda bwandi. Nomba umulume wandi cine cine akantemwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rubeni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu calola mukuti “Moneni umwana umwaume.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe Leya aba nakabili pabukulu, apaapa no mwana umwaume, asosa ati, “Nico Yawe alyumfwa ukuti nshatemwikwa, eico ampeelela umwana na umbi.” Kanshi epakumwinika ishina lya Simeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Simeoni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu ili shiwi lyapala nokuti “Alomfwa.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leya nakabili aba pabukulu, apaapa no mwana umwaume. Lyena asosa ati, “Nomba ino nshita umulume wandi akansakamana, pantu nimufyalila abana abaume batatu.” Kanshi epakumwinika ishina lya Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Levi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu calola mukuti, “Ukuikumika” Uyu Levi e cikolwe ca bashimapepo abena Levi nga Aroni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabili Leya aba pabukulu, apaapa no mwana umwaume. Elyo asosa ati, “Lino lyena ndelumbanya Yawe.” Kanshi epakwinika umwana ishina lya Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:35",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yuda:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu calola ku malumbo. Yuda e cikolwe catuntukako Davidi pamo pene na Yesu wine.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Awe Leya atala aiminina mu bufyashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
